        "subject": "Portal: serve the approved legal and support pages on dukan.tsxmr.com",
        "body": "Portal: serve the approved legal and support pages on dukan.tsxmr.com\n\nThe portal footer linked to tsxmr.com, whose pages are the pre-launch\ntexts. A portal build now serves the approved Dukan ERP texts itself at\n/in-app/<page> (+ /fr, /ar): privacy and account deletion 1.1, the\nothers 1.0, effective 2026-11-04. Footer links are local; the page head\nemits no tsxmr.com canonical or alternates; the edge rewrites the in-app\naddresses to the shell. /admin stays unrouted in a console-less build.\n\nTests: every page in EN/FR/AR opened directly, versions, language\nswitch, footer links local, and a regression check that no link,\ncanonical or alternate points back to tsxmr.com's legal texts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
